\newlabel{code:jupyter}{{2}{2}{Application-specific Jupyter commands built from predefined LLM commands. In this example, \texttt {LLM.type\_answer} answers an uttered instruction directly, whereas \texttt {LLM.type\_text\_answer\_to} answers with respect to selected text or clipboard content; the first command types an IPython magic for a spoken task and the second types a markdown explanation of the selected cell}{lstlisting.2}{}}
